Subtask 2.2: Create Placement Rules
Create Placement Rule for All Clusters
Create a file named all-clusters-placement.yaml:

apiVersion: apps.open-cluster-management.io/v1
kind: PlacementRule
metadata:
  name: all-clusters-placement
  namespace: policy-management
spec:
  clusterConditions:
    - status: "True"
      type: ManagedClusterConditionAvailable
  clusterSelector:
    matchExpressions:
      - key: environment
        operator: In
        values:
          - production
          - development
          - staging
Create Placement Rule for Production Clusters Only
Create a file named production-clusters-placement.yaml:

apiVersion: apps.open-cluster-management.io/v1
kind: PlacementRule
metadata:
  name: production-clusters-placement
  namespace: policy-management
spec:
  clusterConditions:
    - status: "True"
      type: ManagedClusterConditionAvailable
  clusterSelector:
    matchLabels:
      environment: production
Apply Placement Rules
# Apply placement rules
oc apply -f all-clusters-placement.yaml
oc apply -f production-clusters-placement.yaml

# Verify placement rules
